{
  "id": "skhod",
  "chapter": 0,
  "title": {
    "ru": "Сход",
    "en": "The Gathering"
  },
  "tags": [
    "death",
    "ceremony",
    "no_combat"
  ],
  "entry": "skhod_entry",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "kind": "branch",
      "id": "skhod_entry",
      "branches": [
        {
          "when": {
            "kind": "deaths",
            "op": "gte",
            "value": 1
          },
          "to": "skhod_again"
        }
      ],
      "fallback": "skhod_floor"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "id": "skhod_floor",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Гумно без края. Под ногами утоптанный ток, и он тёплый — как бывает тёплой земля там, где долго молотили. Стен нет, а гулко, как в закрытом.",
        "en": "A threshing floor with no edge. Underfoot the beaten ground is warm — the way ground is warm where threshing went on a long time. There are no walls, and yet it echoes as though closed in."
      },
      "keywords": [
        {
          "match": {
            "ru": "Гумно",
            "en": "threshing floor"
          },
          "tone": "lore"
        }
      ],
      "next": "skhod_queue"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "id": "skhod_queue",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Очередь стоит боком, трое. Их уводят по одному, и никто не оборачивается посмотреть куда. Ты встаёшь последним, потому что так стоят.",
        "en": "The queue stands sideways, three of them. They are taken one at a time, and nobody turns to see where. You stand last, because that is how one stands."
      },
      "next": "queue_dead_shcherb"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "id": "queue_dead_shcherb",
      "speaker": "mertvyy_v_ocheredi",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Ты тоже оттуда, где стол на двоих? Я ставил. Не помню кому, а ставил.",
        "en": "Are you from there too, where the table is set for two? I used to set it. I do not remember for whom, but I set it."
      },
      "keywords": [
        {
          "match": {
            "ru": "стол на двоих",
            "en": "the table is set for two"
          },
          "tone": "danger"
        }
      ],
      "next": "queue_dead_after"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "id": "queue_dead_after",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Он щербатый на левую сторону — не лицом, а всем: рукав пустой там, где не рука, а привычка. Пока ты думаешь, что ответить, его уводят.",
        "en": "He is notched down his left side — not in the face but all over: the sleeve is empty where there is no arm, only a habit. While you are working out what to answer, he is taken."
      },
      "next": "golos_first"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "id": "golos_first",
      "speaker": "golos_iz_trukhi",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Не вспомнил — не прошёл. Правило старше нас, и мы его не писали.",
        "en": "Not remembered, not let through. The rule is older than we are, and we did not write it."
      },
      "keywords": [
        {
          "match": {
            "ru": "Не вспомнил — не прошёл",
            "en": "Not remembered, not let through"
          },
          "tone": "name"
        }
      ],
      "next": "golos_why"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "id": "golos_why",
      "speaker": "golos_iz_trukhi",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Тебя держат не в наказание. Нам нужен свидетель, которого нельзя съесть. Другого у нас нет.",
        "en": "You are not held here as punishment. We need a witness who cannot be eaten. We have no other."
      },
      "next": "skhod_confirm"
    },
    {
      "kind": "branch",
      "id": "skhod_confirm",
      "branches": [
        {
          "when": {
            "kind": "counter",
            "counter": "_shards",
            "op": "lt",
            "value": 2
          },
          "to": "golos_empty"
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "kind": "flag",
            "flag": "oklik_refused"
          },
          "to": "golos_no_name"
        }
      ],
      "fallback": "golos_borrowed"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "id": "golos_no_name",
      "speaker": "golos_iz_trukhi",
      "text": {
        "ru": "На окликe ты не соврал. Пустое — не ложь. Признано.",
        "en": "At the hail you did not lie. Empty is not a lie. Acknowledged."
      },
      "next": "skhod_zarubka"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "id": "golos_borrowed",
      "speaker": "golos_iz_trukhi",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Ты назвался чужим. Чужое здесь не в счёт: чужим именем к нам приходили и до тебя. Признано другое.",
        "en": "You gave another's name. Another's does not count here: people have come to us under other names before you. Something else is acknowledged."
      },
      "next": "skhod_zarubka"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "id": "golos_empty",
      "speaker": "golos_iz_trukhi",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Пусто. Подтверждать нечего: ты прожил сутки так, что и вспоминать нечем. Ступай обратно и сделай что-нибудь, что удержится.",
        "en": "Empty. There is nothing to acknowledge: you lived the day in a way that leaves nothing to remember by. Go back and do something that will hold."
      },
      "keywords": [
        {
          "match": {
            "ru": "Подтверждать нечего",
            "en": "nothing to acknowledge"
          },
          "tone": "danger"
        }
      ],
      "next": "skhod_empty_out"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "id": "skhod_empty_out",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Труха у ног не собирается ни во что. Щепка в кулаке та же, и мест под зарубки на ней столько же, сколько было утром.",
        "en": "The dust at your feet gathers into nothing. The stick in your fist is the same, and there are as many places for notches on it as there were in the morning."
      },
      "next": "death_oklik"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "id": "skhod_zarubka",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Труха у тебя под ногами собирается в кучку и оседает обратно. В кулаке — щепка, и на ней место под зарубку, которого утром не было.",
        "en": "The dust at your feet gathers into a little heap and settles back. In your fist is the stick, and on it a place for a notch that was not there in the morning."
      },
      "keywords": [
        {
          "match": {
            "ru": "зарубку",
            "en": "a notch"
          },
          "tone": "memory"
        }
      ],
      "next": "zarubka_ladder"
    },
